## Per-Project Overrides

A `CLAUDE.md` in a project root (or `<project>/.claude/CLAUDE.md`) takes precedence over this file. Use those to document project-specific architecture, build commands, conventions, latency budgets, and constraints. This file holds the cross-project defaults.
